  "solution": {
    "text": "We have, <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ϕ</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo></math><br /><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>[</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ϕ</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>]</mo></math><br /><br />On differentiating both sides w.r.t. <math><mi>x</mi></math>, we get<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ϕ</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>.</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ϕ</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ϕ</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>ϕ</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></math> ...(i)<br /><br />Since, <math><msup><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>′</mo></mrow></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></msup><mi>&nbsp;</mi></mrow></mfrac></math> (given)<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>ϕ</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ϕ</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mn>5</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br />From Equation (i),<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ϕ</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mo>[</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ϕ</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>]</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ϕ</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mn>5</mn></msup></math>",
